flowchart TB
    Input[User Interaction] --> UI[Spatial Interface]
    UI --> AI[AI Runtime]
    AI --> Services[System Services]
    Services --> Security[Security Capability]
    Security --> Runtime[Application Runtime]
    Runtime --> HAL[Hardware Abstraction]
    HAL --> Kernel[Linux Kernel and Drivers]
    UI -. rendered state .-> Input
    AI -. task data .-> Services
    Security -. allow or deny .-> Services
    HAL --> External[Display Camera Sensor AI Projector]
    AI -. policy-approved egress .-> Cloud[Cloud Services]
